        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Josh Stolberg, Jack Black, Todd Phillips, Alexandre Aja, Laura Ziskin\n- Films: Man-Witch, Piranha 3D, House on Sorority Row, Piranha\n- Books: The Spellman Files, The Candy Shop Wars\n- Topics: screenwriting, remakes, book adaptations\n\nFacts:\n- Josh Stolberg co-wrote the script for Man-Witch, a film starring Jack Black and directed by Todd Phillips.\n- Josh Stolberg co-wrote the scripts for remakes of House on Sorority Row and Piranha 3D.\n- Piranha 3D is a 2010 American 3D horror comedy film.\n- Piranha 3D is a loose remake of the 1978 horror film Piranha.\n- Alexandre Aja directed Piranha 3D.\n- Josh Stolberg co-wrote the book adaptation of The Spellman Files, which was produced by Laura Ziskin.\n- Josh Stolberg also co-wrote the book adaptation of The Candy Shop Wars.",
